 text-anchor="middle" class="cell-label" fill="#725016">Fixture</text><rect x="912" y="491" width="76" height="36" rx="6" fill="#1f5e77"/><text x="950" y="515" text-anchor="middle" class="cell-label" fill="#fff">Real</text></g><text x="22" y="568" class="lane-hint">Each row is a separate check. Rows do not combine into one end-to-end proof.</text></svg></div><div class="lane-detail" id="lane-detail" aria-live="polite"><div><h3 id="lane-title"></h3><p id="lane-copy"></p><a id="lane-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a></div><button id="lane-assertions" type="button">See detailed assertions</button></div></section><section id="refresh" class="graph-panel"><h2>What the database refresh regression checks</h2><p>Three asserted outcomes under the same transaction boundary. The fixture uses a fake scorer upstream and real PostgreSQL for loading.</p><p class="mobile-hint">Scroll horizontally to follow each outcome.</p><div class="graph-scroll"><svg class="refresh-graph" viewBox="0 0 1080 480" role="img" aria-labelledby="refresh-title refresh-desc"><title id="refresh-title">Database refresh behavior asserted by the transaction regression</title><desc id="refresh-desc">A newer capture replaces derived state, removes unreferenced funders, and commits while retaining untouched references. An exact retry returns already loaded without database writes. An equal capture time raises an error and rolls back all changes.</desc><defs><marker id="arrow-teal" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10Z" fill="#1f5e77"/></marker><marker id="arrow-amber" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10Z" fill="#9b641e"/></marker></defs>
